# Lush Portico (Forest Plains) enters tapped and its enters trigger surveils 1; the Mountain on top of the library is
# kept there, so the library is untouched, and the tapped Portico taps for {G} or {W} the turn after.

[Bot1 Deck]
Lush Portico
Island x6
Mountain
Island x9

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

